---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us — DoxaRank | Ethiopia SEO SaaS" description="Learn about DoxaRank's mission to empower Ethiopian businesses, developers, and marketing agencies with world-class, localized SEO software.">
  <div class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200/60 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Our Mission
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
        Building the SEO infrastructure for Ethiopia's digital economy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Global SEO platforms overlook Ethiopian search dynamics. DoxaRank was engineered to provide accurate, localized search intelligence for businesses operating in Ethiopia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Story / Context -->
    <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg mb-20">
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          The Problem with Traditional SEO Tools in Ethiopia
        </h2>
        <p>
          For years, digital marketers and developers in Addis Ababa and across Ethiopia had to rely on international SEO platforms. These tools presented major friction points:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4 border-l-2 border-emerald-500 text-base text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>No Google Ethiopia accuracy:</strong> SERP results were tracked from US or European datacenters, yielding rankings that diverged sharply from what actual users in Ethiopia see on <code class="text-emerald-700 font-mono">google.com.et</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Amharic language support:</strong> Keyword research engines failed to handle Ethiopic Fidel scripts or common orthographic variations (such as homophone normalization between ሀ, ሐ, and ኀ).</li>
          <li><strong>Foreign exchange friction:</strong> Recurring subscriptions required foreign currency credit cards, creating artificial barriers for local startups and agencies.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-3xl p-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Localized Engineering</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            DoxaRank integrates directly with local IP routing for true Google Ethiopia position tracking, Amharic Fidel normalization, and automated crawling optimized for <code class="text-emerald-700 font-mono">.et</code> and global domains.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-3xl p-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Local Currency Billing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Through Doxa Payments, subscriptions are transparently billed in Ethiopian Birr (ETB), supporting Telebirr and local bank transfers so you never have to worry about forex card limits.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Values -->
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 text-center mb-10">
        Our Operating Principles
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Technical Rigor</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We prioritize actionable, rule-based auditing data and verifiable SERP positions over vanity metrics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Ethiopian Context</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">From language normalization to local payment integrations, every feature is tailored for Ethiopian search reality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Data Privacy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Read-only integrations for Google Search Console and GA4 with secure OAuth protocols and audit trails.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
